# Private/local game source. Keep commercial game code out of the public QOS repo.
# Allow only the tiny public QOS wrapper/build scaffold.
programs/game/*
!programs/game/
!programs/game/.gitignore
!programs/game/README.md
!programs/game/Makefile
!programs/game/program_main.c
